        },
        {
          "text": "Ngathi: USolomoni inkosi yakoIsrayeli konanga yini ngenxa yabafazi abanje? Ezizweni ezinengi kwakungekho inkosi enjengaye, wayethandeka kuNkulunkulu wakhe, uNkulunkulu wamenza inkosi yakoIsrayeli wonke; kantike abafazi bezizweni bamenza laye ukuba one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
